  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Management and coordination of hospital feeding in Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD is managing a contract allowed by Caritas Germany to provide food supplies to the poor and needy people who seek medical assistance in 10 hospitals in the Archdiocese of Bulawayo and Harare. Respective CADECs will coordinate field level activities that happends at 10 hospital sites and CAFOD Harare team will assume overall responsibility to ensure timely information flow and submission of reports.

Aproportioned time is being allocated from CAFOD staff in Harare to manage this project which will reach patients who are admitted in hospitals, outpatients who are chronically ill and malnourished and hospital staff members as well as nursing students with food assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
